      "title": "RATEGAIN: New AI And Payments Push Will Likely Leave Shares Overpriced",
      "body": "Analysts have kept the price target for RateGain Travel Technologies steady at ₹520, citing only minor adjustments to assumptions on discount rate, revenue growth, profit margins, and future P/E that largely offset one another. What's in the News RateGain launched RG Pay, a unified payments platform for travel and hospitality that combines localized payment acceptance, affordability options such as BNPL and EMI, virtual card management, and cross-border settlement within a single infrastructure.",
