      "title": "RATEGAIN: AI Travel Data Platform Will Drive Future Upside Potential",
      "body": "Analysts have kept their fair value estimate for RateGain Travel Technologies steady at ₹875.0. The unchanged price target reflects offsetting tweaks to assumptions, including a slightly higher discount rate, more measured revenue growth expectations, a modestly stronger profit margin outlook, and a higher future P/E multiple. What's in the News RateGain launched RG Pay, a unified payments infrastructure aimed at improving revenue realization, payment flexibility, and cross-border settlement for hotels, OTAs, and travel partners across global markets.",
